There are the two scrolls of earth from the first (lowest) Sokoban level;
if you haven't already wasted these read them at some place such that you
don't block yourself on the way forth or back.

Otherwise a wish might help, but the Sokoban price is not worth a wish,
since you can also wish for the price instead.

And, you know, you don't necessarily need Sokobans price to continue your
game.

For the future keep in mind that you may squeeze onto a boulder square if
you drop (nearly) everything in your inventory. Sometimes that helps in a
seemingly hopeless situation.

